.DS_Store
# P5 perf-hunt deploy prune — never fetched on the happy path (see
# docs/p5/perf-hunt.md §deploy-prune). Files stay in public/ so dev +
# vite preview (?look= routes) keep working; wrangler just never uploads
# them. Missing-on-prod behavior verified graceful: loadHdrEnv catches,
# console warns, procedural/boot env stands in.
assets/env/studio_small_03_2k.hdr
assets/looks/porcelain.hdr
assets/looks/dusk.hdr
# bundled transcoder duplicates — runtime loads /assets/basis/ (kept)
assets/basis_transcoder-*
# sourcemaps are dev artifacts; 4.4 MB of deploy weight nobody fetches
assets/*.js.map
